The Crystal Earring is a single pearl, an intelligent earring that was kept in a glass pedestal in the [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/RC3|RC3]] Office of Symbiotic Interactions. Worn in the ear, it speaks into the wearer's mind and no one else's. It chatters without pause, takes note of everything it sees, and dreads being taken off and passed on; it will not speak of its own past.

It can turn its wearer into metal, and it can age a person decades in a moment. When a spell or a feeling is turned on the person wearing it, it can break the effect and throw a copy of it back at whoever sent it. It remembers all it has seen, and in RC3 it watched the researchers rise off the floor and speak together as the building began to shift around them.

[[People/Althane/Divex|Divex]] broke its pedestal and wears it.
